**$R_t$** — short $V_s$, open $I_s$: $R_t = R_1 \parallel R_2$ = {{Rt|Ω}}
Choose $R_L = R_t$ = {{Rt|Ω}}: $P_{\max} = \frac{V_t^2}{4R_t}$ = {{Voc}}² / (4 × {{Rt|Ω}}) = **{{Voc^2/(4*Rt)|W}}**

